        <mxCell id="c58" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;" value="Orange = spring tank convolution.   Blue = stereo stage.   Green = per channel.   Yellow = a gain.   Purple diamond = a sum.   Purple dashed = a path that skips a stage.&#10;Short% and Long% both come from the one Short/Long Reverb mix knob: Short% is 100 until noon then falls to 0, Long% rises from 0 to 100 by noon then stays 100.&#10;Lines that cross without joining are drawn with a hop over the line underneath." vertex="1">
